## 2. Walkthrough & Exam Drills

### Drill 1: Services & CoreDNS Discovery (`01-services/`)

1. **Deploy Multi-Port Application**:

   ```bash
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_networking_dir }}/01-services/cka-lab-backend-app.yaml
   kubectl rollout status deployment/cka-lab-backend-app
   ```

1. **Deploy ClusterIP & NodePort Services**:

   ```bash
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_networking_dir }}/01-services/cka-lab-clusterip-service.yaml
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_networking_dir }}/01-services/cka-lab-nodeport-service.yaml
   kubectl get svc -l cka.practice/scenario=networking
   # Modern EndpointSlice discovery (v1.33+ standard):
   kubectl get endpointslices -l kubernetes.io/service-name=cka-lab-clusterip-svc
   ```

1. **Test CoreDNS and NodePort Connectivity (Non-Interactive)**:

   ```bash
   {{ cka_lab_networking_dir }}/01-services/test-services.sh
   ```

### Drill 2: Ingress Path Routing (`02-ingresses/`)

1. **Deploy Web & API Backends**:

   ```bash
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_networking_dir }}/02-ingresses/cka-lab-ingress-backends.yaml
   ```

1. **Apply Ingress Resource**:

   ```bash
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_networking_dir }}/02-ingresses/cka-lab-ingress.yaml
   kubectl get ingress cka-lab-ingress
   ```

1. **Verify Ingress Path Routing**:

   ```bash
   {{ cka_lab_networking_dir }}/02-ingresses/test-ingress.sh
   ```

### Drill 3: Gateway API with NGINX Gateway Fabric & Caddy (`03-gateway-api/`)

1. **Ensure NGINX Gateway Fabric and httpbin-go are Deployed**:

   ```bash
   # From ~/cka/helm if not already deployed:
   ~/cka/helm/install-nginx-gateway-fabric.sh
   ~/cka/helm/install-httpbin-go.sh
   ```

1. **Deploy Gateway and HTTPRoute**:

   ```bash
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_networking_dir }}/03-gateway-api/cka-lab-gateway.yaml
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_networking_dir }}/03-gateway-api/cka-lab-httproute.yaml
   kubectl get gateways,httproutes
   ```

1. **Edge TLS & Caddy Forwarding**:

   Read the architecture guide at `{{ cka_lab_networking_dir }}/03-gateway-api/cka-lab-caddy-integration.md` explaining how external port 443 requests arriving at Caddy are forwarded to NodePort 30443 on worker nodes and routed via HTTPRoute.

1. **Execute Non-Interactive Gateway API Test**:

   ```bash
   {{ cka_lab_networking_dir }}/03-gateway-api/test-gateway.sh
   ```

### Drill 4: Network Policies with httpbin-go (`04-network-policies/`)

1. **Deploy Isolated Namespaces & Workloads**:

   ```bash
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_networking_dir }}/04-network-policies/cka-lab-namespaces.yaml
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_networking_dir }}/04-network-policies/cka-lab-backend-workload.yaml
